{
    "title": "Survival 456 But It's Impostor",
    "description": "Are you a fan of the 456 Survival Challenge? Or are you a fan of Impostor Crewmate? Join us in Survival 456 But It's Impostor game. A combination of two top-notch theme games can make you satisfied. Old but gold!\r\n\r\nHave you ever heard about the crazy survival in this game? You must be careful in every footstep because other players are watching you. Easy to play but not easy to win. \r\n\r\nGame Features\r\n\u2736 Many levels with different difficulty\r\n\u2736 Levels are constantly being updated\r\n\u2736 Simple design, easy to control\r\n\ud83d\udd28 Beautiful graphics: everything you see in this world will be impostors and crewmates\r\n\ud83d\udd28 Smooth control: 456 survivor game will be so satisfying to experience.\r\n\ud83d\udd28 Daily update: new level will be updated every day so that your survival game can go on forever.\r\n\ud83d\udd28 More than 100 levels: so many 456 challenges for you to explore.\r\n\ud83d\udd28 Various boss fights: scary bosses are waiting for you, do you dare to face them?\r\n\ud83d\udd28 Simple gameplay: the game is easy to play, let\u2019s escape the guard together.\r\n\ud83d\udd28 Completely free: You don\u2019t have to pay any money to play this impostor game.\r\n\ud83d\udd28 Available for both kids and adults: 456 game for everyone.\r\n\ud83d\udd28 Both phones and tablets are supported.\r\n\r\nHow to play Survival 456 But It's Impostor game:\r\n\r\n123 Run\r\n\r\n\u03df Touch the 456 player to move\r\n\u03df Run fast while the officer is counting\r\n\u03df Stand still when the officer turns his head\r\n\u03df Be one of the 5 people to finish first\r\n\u03df The game will end if you reach the finish line late and let the red light see you move\r\n\r\nGlass Bridge\r\n\r\n\u03df You will randomly receive a number that will determine what turn you will take this challenge on\r\n\u03df Press R to jump to the right pane\r\n\u03df Press L to jump to the left pane\r\n\u03df Try to complete the passage by not letting yourself fall\r\n\u03df Use boosters to take on challenges easily\r\n\r\nBattle mode\r\n\r\n\u03df Night falls, no one is safe in the playground\r\n\u03df Pick up your weapon to defend yourself\r\n\u03df Defeat others or you will be defeated\r\n\u03df Use booster to get more power\r\n\r\nTug of War\r\n\r\n\u03df Recruit the strongest crewmates to your team\r\n\u03df Use your ingenuity and intelligence to pass the level and survive\r\n\r\nCandy Challenge\r\n\r\n\u03df Randomly select a box of candy to do the challenge\r\n\u03df Separate the candy according to the shape inside the box\r\n\u03df You better not do wrong in this challenge, because you can be defeated at any time\r\n\u03df There is always the option to lick the candy if the shape inside the candy box is too difficult for you\r\n\r\nMarbles\r\n\r\n\u03df You and your teammates must face each other directly to survive\r\n\u03df Only one person is allowed to survive\r\n\u03df Try to throw the marble as far as you can\r\n\r\n\u03df You can choose your player's number. It can be 446, 465, 556 436, 452, 462, 546, or any number you want. It\u2019s a survival run for your life!\r\n\r\n\r\n4\ufe0f\u20e3 5\ufe0f\u20e3 6\ufe0f\u20e3 Attention all players, the 456 survival challenge is about to begin!!! 4\ufe0f\u20e3 5\ufe0f\u20e3 6\ufe0f\u20e3\r\n\r\nWould you like to become participant number 465? Beat off other competitors and be the only one who wins 46.5$ billion. Pass all the levels to become the champion and get the reward you deserve. Enjoy your mangus, and enjoy your playtime with this game.\r\n\r\nIf you love the Survival 456 But It's Impostor game, rate us 5\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f and leave your feedback below. Your support is always the motivation for us to continue to develop even better products in the future.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you a fan of the 456 Survival Challenge? Or are you a fan of Impostor Crewmate? Join us in Survival 456 But It&#39;s Impostor game. A combination of two top-notch theme games can make you satisfied. Old but gold!<br><br>Have you ever heard about the crazy survival in this game? You must be careful in every footstep because other players are watching you. Easy to play but not easy to win. <br><br>Game Features<br>\u2736 Many levels with different difficulty<br>\u2736 Levels are constantly being updated<br>\u2736 Simple design, easy to control<br>\ud83d\udd28 Beautiful graphics: everything you see in this world will be impostors and crewmates<br>\ud83d\udd28 Smooth control: 456 survivor game will be so satisfying to experience.<br>\ud83d\udd28 Daily update: new level will be updated every day so that your survival game can go on forever.<br>\ud83d\udd28 More than 100 levels: so many 456 challenges for you to explore.<br>\ud83d\udd28 Various boss fights: scary bosses are waiting for you, do you dare to face them?<br>\ud83d\udd28 Simple gameplay: the game is easy to play, let\u2019s escape the guard together.<br>\ud83d\udd28 Completely free: You don\u2019t have to pay any money to play this impostor game.<br>\ud83d\udd28 Available for both kids and adults: 456 game for everyone.<br>\ud83d\udd28 Both phones and tablets are supported.<br><br>How to play Survival 456 But It&#39;s Impostor game:<br><br>123 Run<br><br>\u03df Touch the 456 player to move<br>\u03df Run fast while the officer is counting<br>\u03df Stand still when the officer turns his head<br>\u03df Be one of the 5 people to finish first<br>\u03df The game will end if you reach the finish line late and let the red light see you move<br><br>Glass Bridge<br><br>\u03df You will randomly receive a number that will determine what turn you will take this challenge on<br>\u03df Press R to jump to the right pane<br>\u03df Press L to jump to the left pane<br>\u03df Try to complete the passage by not letting yourself fall<br>\u03df Use boosters to take on challenges easily<br><br>Battle mode<br><br>\u03df Night falls, no one is safe in the playground<br>\u03df Pick up your weapon to defend yourself<br>\u03df Defeat others or you will be defeated<br>\u03df Use booster to get more power<br><br>Tug of War<br><br>\u03df Recruit the strongest crewmates to your team<br>\u03df Use your ingenuity and intelligence to pass the level and survive<br><br>Candy Challenge<br><br>\u03df Randomly select a box of candy to do the challenge<br>\u03df Separate the candy according to the shape inside the box<br>\u03df You better not do wrong in this challenge, because you can be defeated at any time<br>\u03df There is always the option to lick the candy if the shape inside the candy box is too difficult for you<br><br>Marbles<br><br>\u03df You and your teammates must face each other directly to survive<br>\u03df Only one person is allowed to survive<br>\u03df Try to throw the marble as far as you can<br><br>\u03df You can choose your player&#39;s number. It can be 446, 465, 556 436, 452, 462, 546, or any number you want. It\u2019s a survival run for your life!<br><br><br>4\ufe0f\u20e3 5\ufe0f\u20e3 6\ufe0f\u20e3 Attention all players, the 456 survival challenge is about to begin!!! 4\ufe0f\u20e3 5\ufe0f\u20e3 6\ufe0f\u20e3<br><br>Would you like to become participant number 465? Beat off other competitors and be the only one who wins 46.5$ billion. Pass all the levels to become the champion and get the reward you deserve. Enjoy your mangus, and enjoy your playtime with this game.<br><br>If you love the Survival 456 But It&#39;s Impostor game, rate us 5\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f and leave your feedback below. Your support is always the motivation for us to continue to develop even better products in the future.",
